        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "By 3: no. By 4: yes. By 12: no.",
          "worked": "By 3: $6+4=10$, which is not divisible by 3, so 64 is not divisible by 3.\n\nBy 4: $64=4\\times16$, so 64 is divisible by 4.\n\nBy 12: 64 is not divisible by 3, so it is not divisible by 12.",
