        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "By 3: no. By 4: yes. By 12: no.",
          "worked": "By 3: $1+3+3+6=13$, which is not divisible by 3, so 1336 is not divisible by 3.\n\nBy 4: the last two digits form $36=4\\times9$, so 1336 is divisible by 4.\n\nBy 12: 1336 is not divisible by 3, so it is not divisible by 12.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 56
      },
      {
        "id": "p25-q13-c",
