        "answer": {
          "short": "By 3: yes. By 4: yes. By 12: yes.",
          "worked": "By 3: $3+9+7+2=21=3\\times7$, so 3972 is divisible by 3.\n\nBy 4: the last two digits form $72=4\\times18$, so 3972 is divisible by 4.\n\nBy 12: 3972 is divisible by both 3 and 4, so it is divisible by 12.",
